---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAME, withBase } from "../../consts";
---

<Layout title="Privacy & cookies" description="Privacy and cookie policy for the JDM Trip website.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-12 sm:py-16 sm:px-8">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy &amp; cookies</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-mist-500">
      This page translates the reference version, the <a href={withBase("/confidentialite/")} class="link-underline text-ink">French privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Data collected</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          {SITE_NAME} requires no sign-up and collects no personal data. No analytics or advertising tool is installed
          on the site for now.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Like any hosting provider, Vercel may record technical connection data (IP address, browser type) in its
          logs, to keep the site secure and running properly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The site sets no analytics or advertising cookies. If such tools are ever added, a banner will ask for your
          consent first, and this page will be updated.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Links to Google Maps or to shop and agency websites take you to third-party sites, which have their own
          privacy policies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, correct and delete data about you. For any question, write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="link-underline font-medium text-racing-500">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
          You can also file a complaint with the CNIL, the French data protection authority
          (<a href="https://www.cnil.fr" class="link-underline text-ink" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cnil.fr</a>).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
